WEBVTT

NOTE Module: Deployment

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.986
In Module 12, we study production deployment and cloud delivery. We cover containerization with Docker, CI/CD automated deployment pipelines, and global CDN caching.

2
00:00:11.986 --> 00:00:21.832
Multi-stage Docker builds isolate the build environment from the production runtime, generating lightweight, secure container images without build tool clutter.

3
00:00:21.832 --> 00:00:32.446
Never commit API keys or database passwords to Git repositories or bake them into Docker images. Always inject secrets at runtime through secure environment variables.

4
00:00:32.446 --> 00:00:41.585
Deploying a live production application completes your Full Stack journey. Your verified evidence will be cryptographically locked in your SEVA Skill Passport.
